### Registrar equipo nuevo
POST http://localhost:5064/api/inventario/individual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroSerie": "DELL-003",
  "marca": "Dell",
  "modelo": "Inspiron 15",
  "procesador": "Intel Core i5",
  "laboratorio": "Laboratorio 1",
  "fechaCompra": "2024-01-15"
}

